OL,3,GNEWSAFlooring firm goes into
OL,4,Aadministration
OL,5,
OL,6,FA flooring firm has cut 154 jobs after
OL,7,Fgoing into administration.
OL,9,FBirmingham-based Headlam said it had
OL,10,Falso closed 28 of its 76 trade
OL,11,Fcounters, but that it would continue to
OL,12,Ftrade while a restructuring takes
OL,13,Fplace.
OL,15,FThe company, which currently employs
OL,16,Faround 1,300 workers, said it will
OL,17,Fundertake a Company Voluntary
OL,18,FArrangement restructuring.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
