OL,3,GNEWSAFlooring firm goes into
OL,4,Aadministration
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe administrators said the firm had
OL,7,Fbeen affected by a number of economic
OL,8,Fchallenges, including cost inflation
OL,9,Fand fragile consumer confidence.
